+## 2026-11-02
+- **The payer's look-alike-address warning works behind the preview password** ([#63](https://github.com/trysarathy/investigation-desk/pull/63)).
+  When a pilot deployment is protected by the preview password, the payment page let the payer in but
+  the address check that page runs was refused, so a payer pasting a poisoned look-alike address got no
+  warning. The check is now reachable from the payment page like the page itself; nothing else in the
+  app was opened up, and every other screen and action still asks for the password. Nothing to do.
+
